Nostyra - third-party Rust crates
=================================

The Nostyra executables (Nostyra.exe, nostyra-runner.exe) contain the open-source
Rust crates listed below, built from their unmodified crates.io releases (source:
https://crates.io/crates/<name>/<version>). Each licence text follows the list of
crates that use it.

Crates under MPL-2.0 are used unmodified; their source code is available from
crates.io at the versions listed. librashader is dual-licensed "MPL-2.0 OR
GPL-3.0-only" and is used under MPL-2.0.

Native C/C++ libraries compiled into the executables (SDL3, SQLite, glslang,
SPIRV-Cross, rcheevos) are listed in THIRD-PARTY-NATIVE.txt.

